:: TempleChoir Work Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'temple-choir-practice-action' 'container'>>
  <<set _practiceKind to _args[1]>>
  <<set _practiceBody to _contents>>
  <<capture _practiceKind _practiceBody>>
    <<lanLink _args[0]>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('TempleChoir')?.practice
          and !$combat and !$possessed and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze
          and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced
          and $stress lt $stressmax and !isPregnancyEnding()>>
        <<set _practiceSource to $passage>>
        <<set _practiceDay to Time.days>>
        <<pass 30>>
        <<if $passage is _practiceSource and $location is 'temple' and Time.days is _practiceDay
            and maplebirch.get('TempleChoir')?.member and $TempleChoir.joined
            and $TempleChoir.practiceDay isnot Time.days
            and !$combat and !$possessed and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze
            and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$eventforced
            and $stress lt $stressmax and !isPregnancyEnding()>>
          <<set $TempleChoir.exercise to _practiceKind>>
          <<set $TempleChoir.practiceDay to Time.days>>
          <<set $TempleChoir.practices += 1>>
          <<print _practiceBody>>
          <<goto 'TempleChoir Practice Result'>>
        <</if>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>>
  <</capture>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'temple-choir-round'>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('TempleChoir').sing(_args[0])>>
    <<pass 20>><<tiredness 2>>
    <<if $TempleChoir.shift.result is 'lost'>><<stress 3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: TempleChoir Practice
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('TempleChoir')?.practice>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The choir gathers around a row of pews. Someone opens the prayer book at Sunday's hymn, while another sounds the starting note. A senior singer asks what you need to work on.<br><br>
      <span class='teal'>Choose one exercise. Practice takes thirty minutes. Recent practice helps you keep your place during the service.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      唱诗班围在一排长椅旁。有人把祈祷书翻到周日要唱的赞美诗，另一人给出起音。一名资深歌者问你，今天想练哪一部分。<br><br>
      <span class='teal'>选择一项练习，耗时三十分钟。最近两天的练习有助于你在弥撒中稳住旋律。</span>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<icon 'temple/hymnbook.png'>>
  <<temple-choir-practice-action `['Practise breathing (0:30)', '练习换气 (0:30)']` 'breath'>>
    <<singingskill 12>><<tiredness 1>><<stress -3>>
  <</temple-choir-practice-action>><<gtiredness>><<lstress>><<gsingingskill>><br>
  <<icon 'temple/hymnbook.png'>>
  <<temple-choir-practice-action `['Match the pitch (0:30)', '练习音准 (0:30)']` 'pitch'>>
    <<singingskill 18>><<tiredness 2>>
  <</temple-choir-practice-action>><<gtiredness>><<gsingingskill>><br>
  <<icon 'temple/choir.png'>>
  <<temple-choir-practice-action `['Rehearse with the choir (0:30)', '排练合唱 (0:30)']` 'choir'>>
    <<singingskill 15>><<tiredness 1>><<grace 1>>
  <</temple-choir-practice-action>><<gtiredness>><<ggrace>><<gsingingskill>><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>><<option 'EN'>>There is no practice available now. Check the choir schedule in your journal.<<option 'CN'>>现在没有可参加的练习。可以在日志中查看唱诗班的时间安排。<</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回大厅'] 'Temple'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: TempleChoir Practice Result
<<if !maplebirch.get('TempleChoir')>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回大厅'] 'Temple'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<switch $TempleChoir.exercise>>
  <<case 'breath'>>
    <<language>><<option 'EN'>>You mark the breathing points with a finger. At first you run out of air before the final word. The singer beside you taps the page, and you try again, taking a smaller breath without lifting your shoulders. By the last repetition you reach the ending together.<<option 'CN'>>你用手指记下换气的位置。起初还没唱到最后一个词，气就用尽了。身旁的歌者点了点书页，你再试一次，收住肩膀，轻些吸气。最后一遍，你们终于一起唱到了句尾。<</language>><<gtiredness>><<lstress>><<gsingingskill>>
  <<case 'pitch'>>
    <<language>><<option 'EN'>>The starting note hangs in the empty hall. You sing it back, listen to the difference and adjust. The higher phrase takes several attempts. Your throat is tired when you close the book, but you can hear where you went wrong.<<option 'CN'>>起音在空荡的大厅里回响。你跟着唱，听出差别，再一点点调整。较高的那句反复试了好几遍。合上书时，喉咙已有些疲倦，但你能听出自己刚才偏在哪里。<</language>><<gtiredness>><<gsingingskill>>
  <<case 'choir'>>
    <<language>><<option 'EN'>>You listen to the singers beside you and practise coming in at the right moment. Someone is absent from the lower part, so you help the others sing it through to the end. After rehearsal, you pass the books along the pew.<<option 'CN'>>你听着身旁歌者的节拍，练习在合适的时候开口。低声部有一人缺席，你便帮着其他人唱完这一声部。排练结束，你把祈祷书沿长椅传回去。<</language>><<gtiredness>><<ggrace>><<gsingingskill>>
  <<default>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        This practice has already ended. The choir schedule is in your journal.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        这次练习已经结束。可以在日志中查看下一次练习的时间。
    <</language>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回大厅'] 'Temple'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>

:: TempleChoir Mass
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Jordan>><<person1>>
<<if maplebirch.get('TempleChoir')?.active and $TempleChoir.shift.round lt 3>>
  <<if $TempleChoir.shift.round gt 0>>
    <<switch $TempleChoir.shift.result>>
      <<case 'clear'>>
        <<language>><<option 'EN'>><span class='green'>Your line reaches the back of the hall. The other voices return around it without losing the beat.</span><<option 'CN'>><span class='green'>你的声音传到大厅后方。其他人的和声围拢回来，节拍没有乱。</span><</language>><<gtiredness>><<lstress>><<gsingingskill>>
      <<case 'unsteady'>>
        <<language>><<option 'EN'>>You waver on the ending. A neighbouring singer holds the note until you find it again.<<option 'CN'>>你的尾音晃了一下。身旁的歌者托住那一个音，等你重新跟上。<</language>><<gtiredness>><<lstress>><<gsingingskill>>
      <<case 'lost'>>
        <<language>><<option 'EN'>><span class='red'>You miss the entrance.</span> Jordan keeps the service moving while the choir covers the silence.<<option 'CN'>><span class='red'>你错过了起句。</span>约旦继续主持弥撒，唱诗班接过声音，填上短暂的空白。<</language>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>><<gsingingskill>>
    <</switch>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<switch $TempleChoir.shift.round>>
    <<case 0>>
      <<robin-temple-mass-presence 'opening'>>
      <<language>><<option 'EN'>>The congregation settles into the pews. Jordan closes the doors and signals the opening hymn. The singer beside you points to the first line.<<option 'CN'>>信众在长椅上坐定。约旦关好门，示意开始唱开场赞美诗。身旁的歌者指了指第一行。<</language>>
    <<case 1>>
      <<language>><<option 'EN'>>Jordan finishes the reading and turns towards the choir. The response begins softly, with a higher phrase halfway through. You have a moment to take your breath.<<option 'CN'>>约旦读完经文，转向唱诗班。答唱轻声起头，中段的音会抬高一些。你还有片刻可以换气。<</language>>
    <<case 2>>
      <<language>><<option 'EN'>>A child rustles the prayer book as the final hymn begins. The congregation joins in. You must listen carefully to keep the choir together beneath their uneven voices.<<option 'CN'>>结束赞美诗开始时，一个孩子把祈祷书翻得沙沙响。信众也加入歌唱。你得仔细听，在参差的声音下稳住唱诗班的节奏。<</language>>
  <</switch>><br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class='teal'>Following the melody is easier. Trying a harmony part gives you more practice, but requires greater skill. Recent practice helps; tiredness and alcohol make singing harder.</span><br>
      Performance so far: <span class='gold'><<= $TempleChoir.shift.score>></span> points. A clear verse earns two points, or three when leading. An unsteady verse earns one.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class='teal'>跟着大家唱比较容易，尝试和声更考验技巧，也能多练习歌唱。最近的练习有帮助，疲劳和醉酒则会妨碍发挥。</span><br>
      当前表现：<span class='gold'><<= $TempleChoir.shift.score>></span> 分。稳稳唱完一节得两分，领唱得三分，勉强跟上得一分。
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<icon 'temple/choir.png'>><<lanLink ['Follow the melody (0:20)', '跟着大家的旋律唱 (0:20)'] 'TempleChoir Mass'>><<temple-choir-round 'follow'>><</lanLink>><<gtiredness>><<gsingingskill>><br>
  <<icon 'temple/choir.png'>><<lanLink ['Try a harmony part (0:20)', '尝试和声 (0:20)'] 'TempleChoir Mass'>><<temple-choir-round 'harmony'>><</lanLink>><<gtiredness>><<gsingingskill>><br>
  <<if $TempleChoir.lead>>
    <<icon 'temple/choir.png'>><<lanLink ['Lead the verse (0:20)', '领唱这一节 (0:20)'] 'TempleChoir Mass'>><<temple-choir-round 'lead'>><</lanLink>><<gtiredness>><<gsingingskill>><br>
  <</if>>

  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave the choir', '退出本次唱诗'] 'Temple'>><<set $TempleChoir.shift to null>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<language>><<option 'EN'>><span class='red'>Leaving before the final hymn earns no allowance bonus for this service. You cannot restart today's service.</span><<option 'CN'>><span class='red'>未唱完结束赞美诗就离开，本次不增加津贴，今天也不能重新参加唱诗。</span><</language>>
<<elseif maplebirch.get('TempleChoir') and $TempleChoir.serviceDay is Time.days
    and $TempleChoir.shift?.round is 3 and (maplebirch.get('TempleChoir').active or $TempleChoir.shift.done)>>
  <!-- 只结算一次；正文、领唱许可与同伴回应在重绘后仍可查看。 -->
  <<if maplebirch.get('TempleChoir').finish()>>
    <<purity 10>><<grace 2>>
    <<if $TempleChoir.shift.score gte 5>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if $TempleChoir.shift.result is 'clear'>>
        The final chord settles cleanly.
      <<elseif $TempleChoir.shift.result is 'unsteady'>>
        Your last note falters, but the choir carries it to the end.
      <<else>>
        You lose the final line and close your book as the others finish.
      <</if>>
      Jordan dismisses the congregation, then calls you over.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if $TempleChoir.shift.result is 'clear'>>
        最后一个和弦稳稳落下。
      <<elseif $TempleChoir.shift.result is 'unsteady'>>
        你的尾音有些摇晃，唱诗班陪着你把它唱完。
      <<else>>
        你没能跟住最后一句，等其他人唱完才合上书。
      <</if>>
      约旦送走信众，随后示意你过来。
  <</language>><<gtiredness>><<if $TempleChoir.shift.result is 'lost'>><<gstress>><<else>><<lstress>><</if>><<gsingingskill>><br><br>
  <<if $TempleChoir.shift.score gte 5>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "You listened to the others. Keep doing that. A choir needs more than a loud voice," Jordan says. <<He>> marks your attendance and records your choir earnings in the allowance ledger.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “你有在听其他人的声音。继续这样做，唱诗班需要的不只是响亮的嗓子。”约旦记下你的出勤，把唱诗加款记入津贴账册。
    <</language>><<glove>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Next time, stay with the quieter line until you're sure of the entrance," Jordan says. "You finished the service. That work still counts." <<He>> marks your attendance and records your choir earnings in the allowance ledger.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “下次先跟着较轻的声部，等起句有把握再往前唱。”约旦说，“你唱完了弥撒，这份工作依然算数。”<<He>>记下你的出勤，把唱诗加款记入津贴账册。
    <</language>>
  <</if>><br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      This service adds <span class='gold'><<printmoney $TempleChoir.shift.bonus>></span> to your monthly allowance. <span class='teal'>Collect it with your temple allowance after a successful monthly examination. If your allowance is withheld, the choir earnings remain on the ledger.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      本次唱诗为月度津贴增加 <span class='gold'><<printmoney $TempleChoir.shift.bonus>></span>。<span class='teal'>月度检查通过后，随神殿津贴一并领取。若津贴被扣发，唱诗加款仍留在账册上。</span>
  <</language>><<gpurity>><<ggrace>>
  <<if $TempleChoir.lead>>
    <br><br>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <span class='green'>"You may lead a response,"</span> Jordan adds. "Watch for my signal. The others will answer you."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        约旦又补了一句，<span class='green'>“你可以领唱答唱。”</span>“看我的示意，其他人会接你的声音。”
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<robin-temple-mass-presence>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回大厅'] 'Temple'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回大厅'] 'Temple'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
